# PLAX
# -------------------------------------------
TITLE       NWC/GEO Satellite Product
SUMMARY     Satellite data
KEYWORDS    Satellite Data
CDM         Image


# Palette Definition
# ------------------------------


# Attributes for Container VIS04
# -------------------------------------------
BLOCK_VIS04
standard_name        toa_bidirectional_reflectance
long_name            0.4 microns visible channel
scale_factor         0.01
add_offset           0.0
units                1
valid_range          0, 65534
_FillValue           65535
ancillary_variables  
coordinates          time ny nx
grid_mapping         projection_definition
comment              
BLOCK_END

